  "_meta": {
    "description": "Default U-values (W/(m2.K)) for opaque walls, floors and roofs by construction/insulation period, climate zone group (H1/H2/H3) and heating type (electric joule vs others), per the 3CL-DPE 2021 lookup tables used when insulation characteristics are unknown. Also carries the uninsulated defaults (U_nu) and simplified window U defaults.",
    "source": "Annexe 1 (méthode 3CL-DPE 2021) de l'arrêté du 31 mars 2021 modifié, version consolidée rt-re-batiment.developpement-durable.gouv.fr : Umur_tab §3.2.1.1 (p.13, table lue depuis le schéma), Umur_nu=Min(Umur0;2,5) §3.2.1, Upb_tab §3.2.2.1 (p.17), Upb0 §3.2.2.2 (p.20), Uph_tab §3.2.3.1 (p.21, variantes combles/terrasse), Uph0=2,5 §3.2.3. Fenêtres : valeurs simplifiées V1 dérivées des tables Uw §3.3.2 (voir notes).",
    "date_accessed": "2026-07-04",
    "notes": "Periods follow the 3CL brackets ('<=74 ou inconnu', 75-77, 78-82, 83-88, 89-00, 01-05, 06-12, '>=13'). The 3CL rule 'Si année de construction <=74 alors année d'isolation = 75-77' is implemented in envelope.py. V1 simplification (documented): a single wall table per zone group H1/H2/H3 (zone letters a/b/c collapse onto their group). Window defaults are a V1 simplification: representative Uw per glazing type, mid-range of the official Uw tables (§3.3.2) across frame materials — the app's simplified journey does not ask for frame material; deviation documented in docs/deviations.md.",
    "units": "W/(m2.K)"
  },
